Architecture
 
Understand our architecture how exactly we are going to build this project.
Source data from Redshift ARC Views, HRSA files, and reference tables is ingested directly into Azure Databricks using JDBC connections. The data is stored in Bronze Delta tables for raw persistence, processed through Silver cleansing and standardization layers, enriched using business matching and fuzzy matching logic, and classified using existing Contract Pharmacy eligibility rules. The curated outputs are stored in Gold Delta tables and exposed through Databricks SQL Views for Qlik Sense reporting. Databricks Jobs orchestrate the end-to-end workflow, while Unity Catalog and SQL metadata tables provide governance, auditing, and load management for both full and incremental processing.


For relational source:
