By directly ingesting data from Redshift and other source systems into Delta Lake. Data flows through Bronze, Silver, and Gold layers where cleansing, matching, fuzzy matching, and eligibility classification are performed. Databricks Workflows orchestrate the end-to-end pipeline, Unity Catalog provides governance and security, and Qlik Sense consumes curated business-ready datasets through Databricks SQL views. This approach improves scalability, performance, maintainability, and support for both full and incremental data processing.
Source is Redshift

Databricks can connect directly to Redshift.

